  "description": "Introducing Graphy, the font that fuses the energetic spirit of street art and the trendsetting vibes of Y2K culture. This unique bubble font is inspired by graffiti and street art, infused with a modern layout that is sure to stand out\nThis unique typeface offers three distinct styles: Filled, Anti Counter, and Outline, whether you’re working on logos, branding, or social media graphics, Graphy adds an urban, contemporary edge that’s sure to make your designs stand out.",
